# P12 W4-1 (docs/design/sdk.md 13.1): Extras > Games lists Solitaire (and,
# in this developer sim, the SDK's test game); SELECT starts a fresh deal
# (draw three by default, Q-SDK-3): the stock and waste top left, four
# empty foundations top right, seven tableau piles of 1..7 cards with the
# top one face up, the cursor's blue frame on the stock. The wheel moves
# the cursor along the shelves (clockwise right; past the top shelf's
# right end onto the tableau's left end); SELECT on the stock turns
# three cards.
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui-mod scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p12-solitaire-start.script
# needs: modules
# reset: mainmenu

wait 4000
sdk_clear            # a fresh deal (the simulator deals from a fixed seed)
wheel +2             # Extras
wait 600
key SELECT
wait 1200
wheel +4             # Games
wait 600
key SELECT
wait 1200
shot games
wheel +5             # Solitaire
wait 600
key SELECT
wait 1500
shot deal
key SELECT           # draw three from the stock
wait 600
shot drawn
wheel +1 300         # the waste
wait 400
wheel +11 600        # along the top shelf, then the tableau to its last pile
wait 600
shot cursor
quit
